&lt;li&gt;Coordinate complex projects in interaction with developers, IT managers and decision makers from various industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Field Engineering and Support in developing and delivering engagement plans that fulfill the customer&#39;s objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
