&lt;p&gt;Partner Engineering works closely with worldwide silicon companies to optimize Ubuntu for their new silicon, from x86, ARM, RISC-V, PowerPC and s390x architectures.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
