&lt;p&gt;The company is founder-led, profitable, and growing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for an energetic and creative Senior Communications Manager with experience in analyst relations (AR) to join our communications team. The ideal person for this role will drive communications strategy through the analyst relations channel in order to increase Canonical’s visibility among industry influencers and shape market perception.&lt;/p&gt;
