&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role of a Technical Author&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;product-focused Technical Author&lt;/strong&gt; is a member of a product engineering team, typically focused on a product or family of products. In this role you&#39;ll help the team develop documentation that serves the needs of the product&#39;s users. You will have responsibility for&amp;nbsp; the quality of the user experience with the product, and will contribute towards the long-term success of the project itself.&lt;/p&gt;
