&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pgdf5j&quot; data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2498&quot;&gt;Genesys Cloud CX certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uxdfjf&quot; data-start=&quot;2499&quot; data-end=&quot;2573&quot;&gt;Experience designing Conversational AI, Voicebot, and Chatbot solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;un64m9&quot; data-start=&quot;2574&quot; data-end=&quot;2695&quot;&gt;Experience integrating Genesys with CRM platforms such as Salesforce, Microsoft Dynamics, SAP, or equivalent solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xiq3wx&quot; data-start=&quot;2696&quot; data-end=&quot;2762&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Agile delivery frameworks including Scrum and SAFe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;odqla2&quot; data-start=&quot;2763&quot; data-end=&quot;2880&quot;&gt;Professional working proficiency in German and familiarity with Swiss banking regulatory and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
